      "text": "BLOCK CACHE\n\n• Cached storage blocks\n• Dirty / clean state\n• Write-back policy\n• Grouped flushes\n\nDirty blocks may remain in memory\nafter transaction commit.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BLOCK CACHE\n\n• Cached storage blocks\n• Dirty / clean state\n• Write-back policy\n• Grouped flushes\n\nDirty blocks may remain in memory\nafter transaction commit.",
