      "text": "PERSISTENT STORAGE\n\nHeap / cell / overwrite storage\n\n• Records and node fields\n• On-disk block layout\n• Updated by cache flushes\n\nNot necessarily flushed at commit.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PERSISTENT STORAGE\n\nHeap / cell / overwrite storage\n\n• Records and node fields\n• On-disk block layout\n• Updated by cache flushes\n\nNot necessarily flushed at commit.",
